<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">5. The lesson presents Mary as the model of prayer. Read her Magnificat (Lk 1:46-55) aloud. What does her prayer reveal about her relationship with God? What does it mean to &laquo;magnify the Lord&raquo; in your own life and circumstances?</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Mary does not magnify herself; she magnifies God. Is your prayer more about yourself or more about God? There is no judgment in the question &mdash; only an invitation.</p>
