</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q">6. Of all the sources of prayer presented in this lesson &mdash; Scripture, Liturgy, theological virtues, daily events, Mary, the saints &mdash; which one do you sense God asking you to cultivate most over the coming week? Make a concrete, specific plan.</p>
<p class="question-block__p">Not &laquo;I will pray more.&raquo; Try: &laquo;I will read five verses of the Gospel every morning before checking my phone&raquo; or &laquo;I will pray one decade of the Rosary on my commute.&raquo; Small and concrete beats large and vague.</p>
