<h4>Activity C: Participate Consciously in the Mass</h4>
<p>At your next Sunday Mass:</p>
<ol>
<li>Arrive five minutes early. Sit in silence. Ask the Holy Spirit to open your heart.</li>
<li>Read the readings beforehand (they are available online at the USCCB website or in any Catholic app).</li>
<li>During the Eucharistic Prayer, pay particular attention to the words of consecration.</li>
<li>After receiving Communion, do not immediately begin the post-Communion hymn in your head. Sit with the Lord who has just entered you. Speak to him, or simply be with him, for as long as the silence allows.</li>
<li>After Mass, write down one phrase from the readings, the homily, or the prayers that you want to carry with you through the week.</li>
</ol>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
