<section class="content">

<h3>Section 5: Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus Christ,<br />
you are the living Word of the Father,<br />
and you have given us streams of living water<br />
from which to drink.<br />
<br />
Open my heart to your holy Scriptures;<br />
let me not read them as dead letters<br />
but hear them as your living voice.<br />
<br />
Draw me deeply into the sacred Liturgy,<br />
that in every Eucharist I may be caught up<br />
into your own prayer to the Father.<br />
<br />
Strengthen in me the virtues of faith, hope, and love,<br />
so that even when I feel nothing<br />
my prayer may rest on your gift and not on my strength.<br />
<br />
Teach me, through the example of the Blessed Virgin Mary,<br />
to magnify you and not myself.<br />
<br />
Let the events of this day become my prayer,<br />
and let my prayer become my life,<br />
until the day when prayer is no longer needed<br />
because I see you face to face.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

</section>

